  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ukraine crisis - cash voucher assistance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The IFRC Regional Office and NLRC aim to support URCS (in Ukraine) in developing and implementing a suitable digital solution to support their CVA programmes in the long term. The Netherlands Red Cross, 510 team, has been specialising in information management within CVA programs since 2019 and is playing an active role in the existing information management landscape for this Emergency Appeal.
This project falls under the Long-Term approach/strategy of the NLRC to the URCS support.</narrative>
  </description>
